      <div class="faq-panel" id="faqPanel">
        <div class="faq-group is-visible" data-category="booking">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-q">
              <span>How do I book a stay on Roovia?</span>
              <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line faq-chevron"></i>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner"><p>Open any listing, pick your dates and guest count, then send a booking request. Once the host confirms, you'll get a confirmation email with your check-in details and the host's contact info.</p></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-q">
